<article class="env-lemma" id="0FJ2">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0FJ2">Lemma <span data-tag="0FJ2">37.62.13</span>.</a> Let </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix{ X \ar[rr]_ f \ar[rd] &  &  Y \ar[ld] \\  &  S }  \]
</div>
  <p> be a commutative diagram of morphisms of schemes. Assume $S$ is locally Noetherian, $Y \to S$ is locally of finite type, $Y$ is regular, and $X \to S$ is a local complete intersection morphism. Then $f : X \to Y$ is a local complete intersection morphism and $Y \to S$ is Koszul at $f(x)$ for all $x \in X$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This is a special case of Lemma <a href="/tag/09RL" data-tag="09RL">37.62.12</a> in view of Lemma <a href="/tag/068B" data-tag="068B">37.61.6</a> (and Morphisms, Lemma <a href="/tag/01T8" data-tag="01T8">29.15.8</a>). 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>